@TimeClock.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5160

### Ping
GET {{TimeClock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health/ping

### Status (replace GUID)
GET {{TimeClock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/status/PUT-EMPLOYEE-GUID-HERE

### Punch IN (example)
POST {{TimeClock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/punch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "PUT-EMPLOYEE-GUID-HERE",
  "punchType": 1,
  "deviceType": 1,
  "deviceId": "WEB-TEST-01",
  "localSequenceNumber": 12345
}
